{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id428692816"}, "name":{"label":"23838338"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-29T00:59:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.47.1"}, "id":{"label":"14239926635"}, "title":{"label":"Customer service is poor"}, "content":{"label":"The customer service is extremely slow, taking several days just to respond to a single message. I have been trying to contact Traveloka to obtain confirmation that the name issue on my flight booking will not cause any problems when I travel.\n\nBefore reaching out to Traveloka, I had already contacted the airline directly. The airline informed me that since I booked the ticket through a travel agency, I need to contact the agency instead. They also mentioned that they cannot guarantee I won’t face any issues when flying due to the duplicated name error.\n\nHowever, Traveloka has assured me that I will definitely not encounter any problems. Therefore, I requested a confirmation email from Traveloka, but I have not received any response at all—not even a reply within two days.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=898244857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
